msgid "or::"
msgstr "ou:"

#: ../../library/tokenize.rst:151
msgid ""
"Note that unclosed single-quoted strings do not cause an error to be raised. "
"They are tokenized as :data:`~token.ERRORTOKEN`, followed by the "
"tokenization of their contents."
msgstr ""

